WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.170
♪♪

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.404
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:06.839
President Biden on Friday

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.841
ordered air strikes
against Syria.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.244
Well, that certainly
didn't take long.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.680
It's like going
to a Chumbawamba concert,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.348
and they open with
"Tubthumping."

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.883
I mean, we knew it was coming.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:19.085
We just didn't know
it would be right away.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.986
According to a new poll
taken at CPAC,

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:23.856
68% of attendees
want former President Trump

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:25.692
to run again in 2024.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.660
Only 68%?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.295
At CPAC?

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.064
It's like if you went
to a Phish concert

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.299
and weed was polling at 68%.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.500
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.836
A giant golden replica
of former President Trump

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:38.304
was displayed over the weekend

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:41.040
at the Conservative Political
Action Conference in Florida.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.741
This news first reported

00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:45.178
in Exodus 32:4.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.646
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.482
President Biden
is facing criticism

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.151
after declining
to directly sanction

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:54.153
Saudi Arabia's
Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:57.223
for ordering the death
of journalist Jamal Khashoggi.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.026
Okay. If having
a journalist murdered

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.695
doesn't count as malarkey,
what does?

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.730
Biden's like one of those
cool parents who says --

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:07.066
[ As Biden ]
If you kids have
to kill someone,

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.002
I'd rather you do it
in the house.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.603
[ Laughter ]
After he was publicly accused

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.672
of sexual harassment
by two former aides,

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:15.942
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
yesterday issued an apology,

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:19.045
even though one aide made
her accusation from a hospital,

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.380
so, to him, it doesn't count.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.781
[ Laughter ]
In his statement addressing

00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:24.884
accusations of sexual harassment
from aides,

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.320
governor Cuomo
said he was "being playful."

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.422
You know how he's
always joking around, right?

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.357
Look at that face.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.826
What a prankster.

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:34.794
[ Laughter ]
Vice President Kamala Harris
had a call

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.063
with the International
Space Station last week.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.398
Even that call
had a better connection

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:42.035
than most calls
at the Golden Globes.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.837
[ Laughter ]
The 78th Golden Globe Awards
were held last night,

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:46.773
after being delayed
for nearly two months

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.307
by the coronavirus pandemic.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.543
Though, you didn't have to wait
the whole two months

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.845
in front of your computer,
Al Pacino.

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:54.213
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:56.115
New York City's
Peter Luger Steak House

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:58.050
has partnered
with Madame Tussauds Museum

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.620
to fill empty seats
in its dining room

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.056
with wax statues of celebrities,
in case you're wondering

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:06.458
where Mike Pence
has been hiding.

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:08.995
[ Laughter ]
And finally, a cat in California

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:10.863
was recently reunited
with her family

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:12.131
after she went missing

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.266
15 years ago, as a kitten.

00:02:14.266 --> 00:02:16.202
Or -- and hear me out --

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.303
cats look alike.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.637
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:20.873
Don't get me wrong.
It's a miracle for your family.

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:21.974
It's not the same cat.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:23.175
♪♪

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:24.310
Former President Trump

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.512
and former First Lady
Melania Trump

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:28.915
reportedly received
the coronavirus vaccine

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:30.750
at the White House in January.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.851
I guess that's alright.
I mean,

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:33.620
he has preexisting conditions

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.955
and she works in elder care.

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.557
[ Laughter ]
That's right,
Trump and Melania received

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.558
the coronavirus vaccine
in January,

00:02:39.558 --> 00:02:40.960
but this is weird --

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.963
January of 2018.

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:45.030
So...

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.832
[ Laughter ]
President Miden --

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:48.735
President Biden -- excuse me --
met virtually

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:51.003
with Mexican President Obrador
yesterday

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:54.173
to discuss immigration;
trade; the pandemic;

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:56.909
and, because it's impossible
to not have an opinion on it,

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.811
"Wandavision."

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.146
Vice President Kamala Harris
today swore in

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:04.617
Dr. Miguel Cardona
as Education secretary

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:07.419
and he's already outperforming
Betsy DeVos.

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:08.654
Raise your right hand.

00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:09.989
Wow!

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:11.057
First try!

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.458
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.327
This guy's good!

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.662
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo's
administration

00:03:16.662 --> 00:03:18.064
announced yesterday

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:20.299
that it has hired
a prominent defense attorney,

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:23.636
as Cuomo faces investigations
into sexual harassment

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.604
and coronavirus
nursing home deaths.

00:03:25.604 --> 00:03:29.742
And, in a sign of just how badly
things are going for Cuomo,

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.310
yeah, it's him.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.979
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:35.748
[ As Giuliani ]
Happy to serve!

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.249
In a new episode
of their podcast,

00:03:37.249 --> 00:03:40.019
former President Barack Obama
sings with Bruce Springsteen.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:43.856
Unfortunately, this country
has determined that you cannot

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:46.758
impeach a president
after they leave office.

00:03:46.758 --> 00:03:48.461
Students
at the University of Texas

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:51.164
have filed a petition to change
their alma mater song,

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:54.600
titled "The Eyes of Texas,"
because it has racist origins.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:58.404
And just wait until they find
out about the origins of Texas.

00:03:58.404 --> 00:04:00.005
[ Laughter ]
It was announced yesterday

00:04:00.005 --> 00:04:02.041
that the first space hotel

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:05.110
will begin construction in 2025
and will include features

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.448
such as restaurants, a health
spa, and a movie theater.

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:10.983
And, if the movie's sold out,
you could always

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:14.454
look at the Earth
from outer space!

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:15.588
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:16.589
What do you think, kids?

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.656
You want to watch Vin Diesel

00:04:17.656 --> 00:04:18.824
struggle through some dialogue,

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:22.795
or do you want
to look at the Earth

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:24.497
from outer space?!

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:25.664
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.664 --> 00:04:26.665
That's right, they're building

00:04:26.665 --> 00:04:29.034
the first space hotel in 2025.

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:32.671
Finally, a hotel where
a room service Caesar salad

00:04:32.671 --> 00:04:35.441
should be $27.

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:37.309
[ Laughter ]

00:04:37.309 --> 00:04:39.512
They don't have anchovies
in space.

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.846
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.846 --> 00:04:42.314
And, finally, actor Seth Rogen

00:04:42.314 --> 00:04:43.516
yesterday announced the launch

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:46.285
of his new cannabis brand,
called Houseplant,

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:49.088
and it must be good, because he
announced it again today.

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:50.990
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.926
After Texas Governor Greg Abbott
announced yesterday

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.262
that he was lifting
coronavirus restrictions,

00:04:56.262 --> 00:05:00.633
California Governor Gavin Newsom
tweeted, "Absolutely reckless."

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.068
But I don't think it helped

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:04.537
that he tweeted it
from The French Laundry.

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:07.340
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki said yesterday

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.309
that states will now receive
2.8 million doses

00:05:10.309 --> 00:05:13.346
of the newly approved
Johnson &amp; Johnson vaccine,

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.214
which is great,
but the question was

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:17.483
about air strikes in Syria.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.752
President Biden said yesterday
that his goal

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.286
is that every teacher
can receive

00:05:21.286 --> 00:05:23.155
the first dose
of the coronavirus vaccine

00:05:23.155 --> 00:05:24.423
by the end of March.

00:05:24.423 --> 00:05:27.560
Said teachers, "May receive."

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.595
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:31.397
Twitter announced
a new system yesterday

00:05:31.397 --> 00:05:33.900
to curb disinformation
about coronavirus vaccines

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.168
on its platform.

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:37.937
Any tweets about vaccines
will contain a flag

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:40.272
to let you know
if the person tweeting it

00:05:40.272 --> 00:05:43.109
was a child star in the '80s.

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:45.578
Former Trump White House
Press Secretary Kayleigh McEnany

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:48.214
joined Fox News yesterday
as an on-air commentator,

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:49.748
so it's kind of like
her old job,

00:05:49.748 --> 00:05:51.584
except, now, she'll be on Fox

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:53.185
a little less.

00:05:53.185 --> 00:05:56.288
Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen
said recently

00:05:56.288 --> 00:05:59.458
that Senator Elizabeth Warren's
proposed tax on millionaires

00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:01.494
could be,
"too messy to implement,"

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:04.930
which was then seconded by the
Senator from East Virginia,

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.365
Guy Realperson.

00:06:06.365 --> 00:06:07.599
Wait a minute!
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:10.603
There's no
Senator Guy Realperson!

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:12.271
And I'm pretty sure
there's no East Virginia.

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:13.472
Check it, Shoemaker.

00:06:13.472 --> 00:06:15.908
According to a new poll,
almost 30% of voters

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:18.511
would entertain the idea
of splitting the country

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:19.845
into smaller regions --

00:06:19.845 --> 00:06:22.982
specifically, two.

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:24.650
[ Laughter ]
Following recent power outages

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.684
amid a winter storm,

00:06:25.684 --> 00:06:27.286
some Texans
were reportedly asked

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:30.923
to treat missed days of work
as vacation days,

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:33.692
while others didn't have
to be asked.

00:06:33.692 --> 00:06:36.896
According to a new report,
people 75 years or older

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:39.598
are the second most vulnerable
to fraud attacks.

00:06:39.598 --> 00:06:41.633
I would say
call your congressmen

00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:44.069
to do something about it,
but they're on the line

00:06:44.069 --> 00:06:46.539
with the reverse mortgage
company right now.

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:49.408
"Don't sell me
down the river, Quigley."

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:53.378
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.378 --> 00:06:55.347
A small porcelain bowl
that was purchased

00:06:55.347 --> 00:06:58.017
at a Connecticut yard sale
for $35

00:06:58.017 --> 00:06:59.785
was recently revealed to be

00:06:59.785 --> 00:07:02.721
a rare 15th-century
Chinese artifact

00:07:02.721 --> 00:07:05.491
worth up to $500,000.

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:08.093
Said the Connecticut homeowner,
"Which is...

00:07:08.093 --> 00:07:09.262
a lot?"

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:13.632
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.632 --> 00:07:16.568
And, finally, a man
in California is facing a fine

00:07:16.568 --> 00:07:18.871
after he allegedly
used a mannequin

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:22.207
for at least a year and a half
to drive in the carpool lane.

00:07:22.207 --> 00:07:23.943
He probably
could have got out of it,

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.279
but his lawyer
didn't say a word.

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:27.313
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:28.814
Still beats Rudy!

00:07:28.814 --> 00:07:30.216
♪♪

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:31.850
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.820
held his first
press conference yesterday

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:35.754
since three women
came forward last week

00:07:35.754 --> 00:07:37.423
to accuse him
of sexual harassment

00:07:37.423 --> 00:07:39.525 line:0%
and it didn't go great.

00:07:39.525 --> 00:07:42.227 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Governor Andrew Cuomo
said yesterday

00:07:42.227 --> 00:07:43.663
that he feels embarrassed

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:46.432
about the multiple allegations
of sexual harassment against him

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:48.167
and added that kissing is his,

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.569
"usual and customary
way of greeting."

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:52.304
I'm not sure
it's a great defense,

00:07:52.304 --> 00:07:56.141
if you're being accused
of bad behavior, to say, "Hey,

00:07:56.141 --> 00:07:59.412
that bad behavior is
how I say hello."

00:07:59.412 --> 00:08:00.913
Also, who greets people
with kisses?

00:08:00.913 --> 00:08:01.913
Are you a Golden Retriever?

00:08:01.913 --> 00:08:03.015
"I'm sorry about him.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:05.684
He just likes the salt
on your skin."

00:08:05.684 --> 00:08:06.818
The Biden administration

00:08:06.818 --> 00:08:08.354
announced a new
project yesterday

00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:11.823
that aims to, "get two million
of the most vulnerable,

00:08:11.823 --> 00:08:15.160
older adults vaccinated
as soon as possible."

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.630
Basically, they're just
going to trick 'em.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:18.965
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:21.300
Acting Capitol Police Chief
Yogananda Pittman

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.668
told lawmakers yesterday

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:24.937
that threats against
members of Congress

00:08:24.937 --> 00:08:26.772
have nearly doubled
over the past year,

00:08:26.772 --> 00:08:29.741
along with a tenfold
increase in threats

00:08:29.741 --> 00:08:31.877
from members of Congress.

00:08:31.877 --> 00:08:33.479
The Washington Football Team
has announced

00:08:33.479 --> 00:08:35.647
that they will replace
their cheerleading squad

00:08:35.647 --> 00:08:37.349
with a co-ed dance team.

00:08:37.349 --> 00:08:39.951
So, yeah, they still
don't understand

00:08:39.951 --> 00:08:41.387
why we're mad at them.

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:42.888
Washington's like
a dumb boyfriend.

00:08:42.888 --> 00:08:44.523
"Okay, I did all the dishes.

00:08:44.523 --> 00:08:45.591
Are you happy now?"

00:08:45.591 --> 00:08:48.560
No! You cheated on me,
you idiot!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.496
[ Laughter ]
According to a new study,

00:08:50.496 --> 00:08:52.064
the United States can expect

00:08:52.064 --> 00:08:55.601
300,000 fewer births this year,
as a result of the pandemic,

00:08:55.601 --> 00:08:57.836
which will save
thousands of lives

00:08:57.836 --> 00:09:01.073
that would have been lost
at gender reveal parties.

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:03.876
Amazon is reportedly
in negotiations with the NFL

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:06.211
for the exclusive rights
to Thursday Night Football,

00:09:06.211 --> 00:09:07.980
in which case, it would become

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.449
Saturday Night Football.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:10.449 --> 00:09:12.285
And, finally,
talk show host Dr. Oz

00:09:12.285 --> 00:09:15.888
helped save a man's life this
week at a baggage claim area

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:17.890
in Newark Liberty
International Airport.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.893
Oz snapped into action
after bystanders called out,

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:23.028
"Help! Help!
Is anybody here

00:09:23.028 --> 00:09:25.064
sort of...a doctor?!"

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:27.934 line:0%
♪♪

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:30.136 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

